      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEDGER'S DESIRE (5) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 3.5 lengths at this track in a handy 18.59. Awkwardly drawn but goes well over this trip. Has won three of three starts from this draw. Hard to fault recent form and looks a key chance again. PAW HART (7) is a capable type and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 18.89 beating Classic Edge. The form from his last run stacks up well. One of the key runners again. MY RUPEE (2) is in the mix despite missing out at this track last time.",
